// top — the residual is the whole unrefined declared type and prints as a BARE
// TYPE NAME. `Kind(string)` compiles, because `string` is lowercase and becomes
// a binder. Same defect class as open-list, reached without a list: any type
// the algebra cannot enumerate lands here.
//
// The obvious route to this shape — an opaque guard calling a local function —
// is NOT usable: erlc rejects the call in a guard, so the fixture would fail
// for a reason that has nothing to do with the printer.
module TopString

public atom Kind(string s)
Kind("a") -> :a
